--- !u!114 &114017697238300914
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1099118695303065}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 1453722849, guid: 67dfb1fdfb2b407222eda8e23ac8b724, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b><size=50>Optimization and AI Patch #2 (v1.2) </size></b>\r\n   Date: 7/6/2022\r\n    \r\nGameplay: \r\n- Player Building limit to 8x8 around the HQ rather than 10x10\r\n\r\nOptimization:\r\n- Massive performance optimization especially for the mid & end game.\r\n- Homing Rockets performance optimization issues.\r\n\r\nAI:\r\n- AI Spawning Rate\r\n- AI Waves Spawning Rate\r\n- EMP won't stun bosses anymore.\r\n- Shield System now recharges to half after being depleted\r\n- Bosses Damage and health Overhaul\r\n\r\n..............................\r\n\r\n<b><size=50>Meta Progression Patch #1 (v1.1) </size></b>\r\n   Date: 7/6/2022\r\n    \r\n- The Game now starts now with 35 Lab Scraps.\r\n- The Game now starts with the fuel tanks, engineers hanger and two more HQ Turrets unlocked.\r\n- Chips lab prices balanced\r\n- Drones Level up rewards now will add more drones to the hangers\r\n- Rating System overhaul allowing for faster early game Progression\r\n- Faster Camera Zooming<b><size=50>Optimization and AI Patch #2 (v1.2) </size></b>\r\n   Date: 7/6/2022\r\n    \r\nGameplay: \r\n- Player Building limit to 8x8 around the HQ rather than 10x10\r\n\r\nOptimization:\r\n- Massive performance optimization especially for the mid & end game.\r\n- Homing Rockets performance optimization issues.\r\n\r\nAI:\r\n- AI Spawning Rate\r\n- AI Waves Spawning Rate\r\n- EMP won't stun bosses anymore.\r\n- Shield System now recharges to half after being depleted\r\n- Bosses Damage and health Overhaul\r\n\r\n..............................\r\n\r\n<b><size=50>Meta Progression Patch #1 (v1.1) </size></b>\r\n   Date: 7/6/2022\r\n    \r\n- The Game now starts now with 35 Lab Scraps.\r\n- The Game now starts with the fuel tanks, engineers hanger and two more HQ Turrets unlocked.\r\n- Chips lab prices balanced\r\n- Drones Level up rewards now will add more drones to the hangers\r\n- Rating System overhaul allowing for faster early game Progression\r\n- Faster Camera Zooming"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7cca016846d2c4e4ea5c7f13805075f7, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 5ef2d15a2751eb34a8abed915f971ef6, type: 2}
